Port 22
AddressFamily inet
HostKey /run/oblivion-hardware/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/oblivion-hardware/sshd.pid
AllowUsers oblivion-test
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/oblivion/hardware/authorized_key.pub
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM yes
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserEnvironment no
PermitUserRC no
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
LogLevel ERROR
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
